A quoted item comment ends the quote before an unclosed fence

````
::: note
> - para
> - %% c
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>para</li>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
  </blockquote>
  <pre><code>code
::::
:::
after *b*
</code></pre>
</aside>
````

````
::: note
> - para
> - {#x}
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>para</li>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
  </blockquote>
  <pre><code>code
::::
:::
after *b*
</code></pre>
</aside>
````

